  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Shrimp Tempura",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s technique for shrimp tempura produces a light, crispy coating that can be used for a variety of other meats and vegetables. Perfect for an appetizer!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-08-30T10:53:46-04:00",
